Here's a basic example of a brute force function in JavaScript that attempts to find a specific number within a given range:

```javascript
function bruteForceSearch(target, start, end) {
  for (let i = start; i <= end; i++) {
    if (i === target) {
      console.log(`Target found: ${i}`);
      return true;
    }
  }
  console.log('Target not found');
  return false;
}

// Example usage:
